# ---- 265 Social Media Marketing
H('265.d.1.A',3,"In-bound marketing attracts customers by offering useful content, while out-bound marketing:","Pushes messages out to many people",["Stops advertising","Waits for customers","Deletes content"],"Out-bound pushes.")
H('265.d.1.A',4,"A blog post answering common product questions is an example of:","In-bound marketing",["Out-bound marketing","Cold calling","Billboard ads"],"Pulls in interest.")
H('265.d.1.B',3,"The nature of in-bound marketing is to draw customers in with:","Valuable, relevant content",["Pressure","Random calls","Junk mail"],"Content attracts.")
H('265.d.1.B',4,"A business using in-bound marketing hopes visitors will eventually:","Become engaged customers",["Delete accounts","Leave forever","Report the site"],"Attract, engage, delight.")
