H('265.d.1.D',3,"Social media marketing is using social platforms to:","Promote a brand and engage customers",["Hide a brand","Remove customers","Cancel ads"],"Definition.")
H('265.d.1.D',4,"A company replying to customer comments on its page is practicing:","Social media marketing",["Door-to-door selling","Print advertising","Cold calling"],"Engagement.")
